knob:
METHOD: Inject a short script in the console that records mousemove coordinates for 30 s, aggregates them, and draws a semi‑transparent heat‑map overlay using a canvas. Example:
```js
(() => {
const pts=[];
const onMove=e=>pts.push([e.clientX,e.clientY]);
document.addEventListener('mousemove',onMove);
setTimeout(()=>{
document.removeEventListener('mousemove',onMove);
const c=document.createElement('canvas');
c.style.position='fixed';c.style.top=0;c.style.left=0;c.style.pointerEvents='none';
c.width=window.innerWidth;c.height=window.innerHeight;
document.body.appendChild(c);
const ctx=c.getContext('2d');
pts.forEach(p=>{ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,0,0,0.03)';ctx.fillRect(p[0],p[1],20,20);});
},30000);
})();
```

